1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,208
My reflection just blinked three seconds after I did, and I am entirely alone in this silent bathroom.

2
00:00:08,508 --> 00:00:14,892
I lean closer to the cold glass, but the woman looking back at me keeps standing completely still.

3
00:00:15,192 --> 00:00:22,104
Panic tightens my chest as I tap my left hand against the surface, yet her hand stays down.

4
00:00:22,404 --> 00:00:29,628
She smiles a warm, sad smile, tilts her head, and slowly reaches out to touch my face.

5
00:00:29,928 --> 00:00:37,248
Cold air rushes through the glass as her fingertips press firmly against the outside of my cheek.

6
00:00:37,548 --> 00:00:43,260
My voice catches in my throat because I realize I am the one trapped inside the frame.

7
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:50,112
She steps out into the bright room, breathing in the fresh air, finally free from the endless loop.

8
00:00:50,412 --> 00:00:57,516
I am left behind in the cold, narrow void, watching my entire life continue without me.

9
00:00:57,816 --> 00:01:04,104
She turns around one last time, looks directly into my eyes, and turns off the bathroom light.

10
00:01:04,404 --> 00:01:11,580
Total darkness swallows me whole. Now ask yourself: which side of the glass are you standing on right now?
